   "he": "חֲמִשָּׁה מְבִיאִין קׇרְבָּן אֶחָד עַל עֲבֵירוֹת הַרְבֵּה. קָתָנֵי: הַבָּא עַל הַשִּׁפְחָה בִּיאוֹת הַרְבֵּה. מְנָלַן?",
   "en": "§ The mishna teaches: There are «five» individuals who «bring one offering for several transgressions,» i.e., for violating the same transgression several times. Among them, the tanna «teaches: One who engages in several» acts of «intercourse with» an espoused «maidservant.» The Gemara asks: «From where do we» derive this halakha?"
